" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Problem</span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y4c6631":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is a title.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y4c6641":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The conglomerate faced significant challenges with their ERP system, JDEdwards:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; letter-spacing:normal;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Inefficient processes caused by <span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">manual data retrieval</span></span> across multiple subsidiaries.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Fragmented workflows</span></span> unique to each brand, complicating data management.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Data visibility issues</span></span>, leading to delays and a lack of operational cohesion.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​Each subsidiary required <span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">tailored solutions for their unique operational needs</span></span> without compromising JDEdwards as the system of record.</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y4c6654":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y4c6654","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-m5y4c667":{"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y4c667","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false}},"comp-m5y4c6677":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y4c6677","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":360}},"translations":{"aria